This project bundles and adapts code from:

- HuggingFace speech-to-speech (https://github.com/huggingface/speech-to-speech),
  Apache-2.0 — the STT/TTS handlers reused by bridge/voice_bridge.py.
- deepseek-harness client plugin scaffold
  (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), MIT — the DSH client
  plugin structure in dsh-plugin/.

The AI-generated media under assets/ (bg-images, task-videos) comes from the
hf-realtime-voice demo workspace and is provided for demonstration only; check
its origin before redistributing commercially.

Full license text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
